      "content": "\"consensus is that the negative impacts... outweigh these targeted benefits\"\n\nthis feels a bit like you're just dismissing the whole idea. if the goal is national security or protecting workers, shouldn't that be treated as an equally valid metric instead of just saying it's a \"net negative\" for \"efficiency\"?",
